    "reason": "[ev-d6a3846e479f] only says that \"the `preferServerCipherSuites` option has been removed\". It does not say which object the option belonged to (TLS options, the TLSOption CRD or something else). It also does not say what happens to a configuration that still sets it: rejected, ignored or something else. The surrounding section is just a list of similar one-line removals ([ev-4a489b1e9ff3], [ev-989a451dfcd4]) and adds nothing. The CRD validator also found spec.preferServerCipherSuites still present in the v3.0.0 TLSOption schema [ev-011956bb7059], which contradicts reading this as a CRD field removal. Text is needed that names the affected configuration surface and describes the effect of leaving the option set.",
